 the official SC Platform VR application by Super Course.\n\nExperience the future of English language learning.\n\nThe SC Platform brings your coursebooks and the entire learning management system into a fully immersive, 3D environment designed for maximum focus and accelerated language acquisition.\n\nWhy SC Platform VR?\nTraditional screens are full of distractions. In the SC Platform, you enter a private, 360\u00b0 virtual study suite where interruptions disappear. Engage your muscle memory by interacting with your material through a high-fidelity spatial interface.\n\nKey features:\n    Zero-distraction environment: A meticulously crafted educational space that eliminates external noise and optimizes focus retention.\n    Spatial UI & interactive media: Organize your workspace exactly how you like it.\n    Natural interaction: Complete your assignments and activities with intuitive gestures and natural movements.\n    Real-time cloud sync: Your progress and grades are synced bi-directionally between your VR headset and the web platform.\n\nImportant notes:\n    Account required: A valid SC Platform student account is required to access the application.\n    Optimized for quest: Supports hand tracking and touch controllers for a seamless spatial experience.", "short_description": "Step into the digital classroom. Experience distraction-free English learning in VR."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.supercourse.gr/policies/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Super Course ELT Publishing", "support_website_url": "https://www.supercourse.gr/erp/sts/", "website_url": "https://www.supercourse.gr/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1043107547362485"}, {"id": "1063584910766706"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": nu